      <h1>Partnerships</h1>
      <p class="lede">
        I'm on TrendAI's Global Alliances team, working across our
        {% term "hyperscaler", "hyperscaler" %} partnerships with most of my time on AWS. I
        handle the technical side of the relationship, working alongside our business-side
        lead.
      </p>
      <p>
        Day to day, that means making sure what we say about Vision One, our cloud and AI
        security platform, holds up when an engineer digs into it. It also means working with
        AWS teams on where our products fit together, building Sales Plays and architecture
        diagrams for AWS sellers, and putting together briefings for leadership on both sides.
      </p>
      <p>
        The part I enjoy most is building things that keep working after I hand them off. A
        partnership needs material people can reuse and a story both companies can tell
        without me in the room.
      </p>
    </div>
