    </div>
    <div class="prose">
      <h2 class="h2-plain">TrendAI Co-Sell IQ</h2>
      <p>
        Co-Sell IQ is a tool I built on the new AWS Partner Central Agent
        {% term "mcp", "MCP Server" %}. It takes the repetitive front end of
        {% term "co-sell", "co-sell" %} off our sellers' plates by improving the quality of
        what we submit to AWS and bringing AWS insights back into the seller workflow. The
        goal was to give sellers more time with customers, not to replace them.
      </p>
      <p>
        I built it over a busy couple of weeks, working closely with Raj Kandaswamy and the
        team at AWS, and it was highlighted in the keynote at the AWS Marketplace Sellers
        Conference. Aaron Barton then had me on AWS Partnerships re:Imagined to talk through
        how it works.
      </p>
      <p>
        <a href="https://go.aws/47oll8Y">Watch the episode: How TrendAI Cut Seller Time with AWS Partner Central Agents</a>
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

